WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.520
When you join a Satipatthana course, the technique remains the same.

00:14.520 --> 00:23.140
You had been coming and participating in a number of courses, the same technique, observing

00:23.140 --> 00:35.340
the five precepts, eight precepts, developing your samadhi with the awareness of respiration

00:35.340 --> 00:42.380
and then developing your panya with the awareness of the sensations and equanimity with the

00:42.380 --> 00:43.820
sensations.

00:43.820 --> 00:48.020
That means equanimity at the deepest level of the mind.

00:48.020 --> 00:52.940
This is what you had been practicing in all the courses and this is what you practiced

00:52.940 --> 00:55.620
now also.

00:55.620 --> 00:59.980
The only difference, a very important difference was...

